# Root Cargo.lock IS committed: this workspace ships binaries and services,
# so builds should be reproducible. Do not ignore it.

# ---- Generated WASM artifacts ----
# Both are rebuilt from source via the commands in README.md ("Run locally"):
#   cargo build -p nullrouter-dashboard-wasm --target wasm32-unknown-unknown --release
#   wasm-bindgen --out-dir services/dashboard-actix/static/pkg ...
/apps/dashboard-leptos/dist/
/services/dashboard-actix/static/pkg/
*.wasm

# ---- Upstream reference (not ours to vendor) ----
# `inspire/` is a read-only clone of https://github.com/decolua/9router kept
# locally as the parity reference. It carries its own .git, so it stays out of
# this tree. Clone it yourself to work on parity:
#   git clone https://github.com/decolua/9router inspire
/inspire/

